{"id":"659388","name":"碱水粽","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/659388/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"糯米","amount":"1000g"}],"sub":[{"name":"粽叶","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"糯米淘洗干净后浸泡2个小时。","img":"images/659388/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"清洗干净的粽叶放锅里煮10分钟。","img":"images/659388/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"捞出用清水浸泡。","img":"images/659388/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"准备适量的食用碱和小苏打。","img":"images/659388/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"捞出泡好糯米，沥干水分。","img":"images/659388/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"把碱面和小苏打倒入糯米中搅拌均匀，粽叶则剪去头尾部分。","img":"images/659388/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"取一片粽叶。","img":"images/659388/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"卷成漏斗状。","img":"images/659388/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"包入糯米压实，九分满即可。","img":"images/659388/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"上端的叶子往下压，捏紧。","img":"images/659388/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"多出来的叶子往右侧折。","img":"images/659388/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"最后用绳子捆紧。","img":"images/659388/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"包好的粽子。","img":"images/659388/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"放入电压力锅，倒入清水浸过粽子，用“豆/蹄筋”键煮至时间结束。","img":"images/659388/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"时间到，出锅。","img":"images/659388/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/659388/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"Q弹软糯，蘸白糖、蜂蜜或炼奶都非常好吃。","img":"images/659388/step_17.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电压力锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}